From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 01:52:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3568/3799] soh: rename func_80B4FDD4 -> EnZl2_PlayFootstepSfx

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: plays NA_SE_PL_WALK_CONCRETE on animation frame 14
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
index c2083deb9..3881b539a 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
@@ -636,7 +636,8 @@ void EnZl2_SetupInitialAction(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->action = 1;
 }
 
-void func_80B4FDD4(EnZl2* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B4FDD4: plays NA_SE_PL_WALK_CONCRETE on animation frame 14
+void EnZl2_PlayFootstepSfx(EnZl2* this) {
     if (Animation_OnFrame(&this->skelAnime, 14.0f)) {
         Sfx_PlaySfxAtPos(&this->actor.projectedPos, NA_SE_PL_WALK_CONCRETE);
     }
@@ -1064,7 +1065,7 @@ void EnZl2_Action2(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnZl2_Action3(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnZl2_BindAnimeObject(this, play);  // was func_80B4FCCC [LLM:HIGH]
-    func_80B4FDD4(this);
+    EnZl2_PlayFootstepSfx(this);  // was func_80B4FDD4 [LLM:HIGH]
     EnZl2_UpdateBgCheck(this, play);  // was func_80B4ED2C [LLM:HIGH]
     EnZl2_UpdateEyes(this);
     EnZl2_UpdateSkelAnime(this);
